cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Find50: IC50 values from concentration-response data and Octet BLI exports"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Khambete
    given-names: Amav
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-18"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ack41704/Find50.py"
keywords:
  - IC50
  - dose-response
  - four-parameter logistic
  - biolayer interferometry
  - Octet
  - medicinal chemistry
abstract: >-
  Find50 reads Octet biolayer interferometry exports, assigns wells to inhibitor
  dilution series, no-inhibitor references and positive controls from their Sample IDs,
  reduces each sensor trace to association, dissociation and area-under-curve readouts,
  and reports absolute and control-relative IC50 values from four-parameter logistic fits
  with model-free interpolation and range-censoring rules.
